@startuml
scale 2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam stateBorderColor #2F5597
skinparam arrowColor #5B6675

title 图 3-5 商品状态图

state "草稿" as Draft
state "待审核" as Pending
state "已发布" as Published
state "已预约" as Reserved
state "已售出" as Sold
state "已下架" as Delisted
state "审核驳回" as Rejected
state "违规下架" as Violation

[*] --> Draft : 创建商品
Draft --> Pending : 提交审核 [必填完整]
Pending --> Published : 审核通过
Pending --> Rejected : 审核驳回 [原因必填]
Rejected --> Pending : 修改后重新提交
Published --> Pending : 修改标题/价格/分类 [版本一致]
Published --> Reserved : 创建预约 [先到先得]
Reserved --> Published : 取消/拒绝/超时
Reserved --> Sold : 卖家标记完成 [48h 内]
Published --> Delisted : 卖家下架 [无有效预约]
Published --> Violation : 管理员违规下架 [原因必填]
Reserved --> Violation : 管理员违规下架 [自动取消预约]
Sold --> [*]
Delisted --> [*]
Violation --> [*]

note right of Published
  修改标题、价格或分类后需重新审核，
  审核期间不可被预约；只改描述或图片
  链接不触发审核。
end note

note bottom of Violation
  违规下架为本期终态，不可重新上架。
end note

legend bottom
  禁止转换：草稿→已预约；已售出→已发布；已下架→已预约；
  违规下架→已发布；已预约→卖家下架。
endlegend

@enduml
